You will be shown a series of Java code snippets, which you should try to comprehend. 
For each snippet you should respond by typing the output of the program.

You are presented the code snippet:

public class Main {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    int[] values = { 3, 0, 1, 0, 2 };
    StringBuilder result = new StringBuilder();
    int variable = 3;
    for (int value : values) {
      if (value == variable) {
        result.append("x");
      } else if (value < variable) {
        result.append("m");
      }
      result.append("o");
      variable--;
    }
    System.out.print(result);
  }
}


Your answer: << x >> << o >> << m >> << o >> << x >> << o >> << o >> << o >> .
